<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - Dutch company results June 30-July 4.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Dutch company results June 30-July 4.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch company results for the week of June 30-July 4:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-----PERIOD--PROFIT------CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS 04/07  OCE	 H1 96/97 net ord ops    99.3    94.9-109   68.6</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They are stated before deduction of preference dividends where applicable.</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: Bangert Pontier, Delta Lloyd Bank, ING Barings, Kempen &amp; Co, Van Lanschot, MeesPierson, NIB Securities.</p>
